[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2917821109","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106916#issuecomment-2917821109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106916","id":2917821109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t6mq1","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-28T23:15:34Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T23:15:34Z","body":"I can reproduce this in 4.4.1 and a recent master (19bb18716e), but it also seems to reproduce in 4.2.1 for me (Linux X11).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2917821109/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3529237019","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106916#issuecomment-3529237019","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106916","id":3529237019,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SW-Ib","user":{"login":"BrotherShort","id":129957860,"node_id":"U_kgDOB77_5A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129957860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort","html_url":"https://github.com/BrotherShort","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-13T18:52:17Z","updated_at":"2025-11-13T18:52:17Z","body":"I debugged it.\nI used CheckBoxs and CheckButtons as test examples.\n\nThe code for CheckBoxs and CheckButtons is similar, but they display differently. CheckBoxs would been resized after the margin changed, but CheckButtons do not.\nAfter theme changed, the CheckBox's code and the CheckButton's code would both go there:\n<img width=\"1488\" height=\"614\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7aea4103-708b-4d61-8d82-b8ce8e4dde91\" />\nThen there:\n<img width=\"1504\" height=\"418\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c05b1955-59fe-4733-8311-0191ee6e1e1a\" />\nAfter `Control::_update_theme_item_cache();`\nCheckBox's `content_margin` would be `-1,-1,-1,-1`:\n\n<img width=\"1485\" height=\"37\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/929074d4-1d50-41ca-bcf4-447471d15a99\" />\n\nBut CheckButton's `content_margin` would be normal value:\n\n<img width=\"1534\" height=\"38\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c82d6c03-e6a9-4241-9b80-078de89008c4\" />\n\nIf the margin was `-1`, the program would use StyleBoxTexture margin later. So CheckBox was resized.\n\n\nWhy CheckBoxs and CheckButtons have different `content_margin`s? What happened in `Control::_update_theme_item_cache();`?\nIn the function, control node would update values by a macro function. \n<img width=\"1512\" height=\"592\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b8741d7-718b-4d4b-b74a-d8d8798c7753\" />\nI don't know how it works, or where values from.\nI stopped here.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3529237019/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3745153009","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106916#issuecomment-3745153009","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106916","id":3745153009,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fOn_x","user":{"login":"BrotherShort","id":129957860,"node_id":"U_kgDOB77_5A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129957860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort","html_url":"https://github.com/BrotherShort","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-13T16:04:26Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T16:04:26Z","body":"Fixed in the recent master(50277787ea).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3745153009/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]